<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: United Drug says H1 pretax profit up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>United Drug says H1 pretax profit up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.57		  vs 10.03</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.0		    vs 2.80</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    3.26		   vs 2.72</p>
<p> Operating profit	 3.50		   vs 3.04</p>
<p>NOTE - Irish-based pharmaceutical company United Drug Plc said.trading in the second half had so far seen a continuation of the trading pattern of the first six months.</p>
<p>&quot;I look forward to another record year in terms of turnover, profits earnings per share and dividends,&quot; chairman Martin Rafferty said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom + 353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
